      "Confirm equal training budget and label the oracle as a ceiling.",
      "Match the coverage claim to the toys estimand.",
      "Require every displayed band to name its meaning.",
      "Check every firing premise and every pitfall check of the study handbooks.",
      "Classify each new finding as defect or limitation in findings.v2. A defect names classification.target (one affected step or node), the reviewed artifact_sha256 and rework_evidence showing why repairing it changes the result.",
